## Architecture Decisions (Locked)

### Block System (Posts)
- 10 blocks: Title, Body, Callout, Hero, Image, Gallery, QuickFacts, Quote, ProsCons, Verdict
- Switch-based rendering
- Discriminated unions
- Renderers receive `{ data, style }`

### Theme System
- Primary + Accent = user-picked (2 pickers only)
- Secondary = derived from primary
- Background = fixed white
- Status colours = fixed
- 6 curated palettes

### Content Library
- `content_library` table
- Categories = filtering only (never rendering)
- Referenced by `portal_items`, never copied

### Portal Wall
- Single pipeline via `portal_items`
- `source_type`: `library` | `portal_specific` | `itinerary`
- Rendering by `type`: pdf | image | text | itinerary
- Wall queries one table + resolves references

### Itinerary
- Separate content type, NOT Portal Blocks
- Chronology-driven (not prominence-driven)
- Travel segments carry flight data
- Stays belong to one section (no cross-section)
- Sequential stays only
- Time-derived ordering (no manual reorder)
- Empty days render intentionally
- Print stylesheet export (no PDF pipeline)

### Notepad
- Admin-only, never rendered to clients
- Comma-separated tags (V1), People table (V2 trigger)
- Logistics notes only (no diagnostic detail)
- TagInput UI pattern only, no post-tag backend coupling

### Templates
- Structural only
- Live templates (edit → all posts update)
- `version: 1` in layoutData

---

## Guardrails (Do Not Violate)

| Guardrail | Applies To |
|-----------|-----------|
| No raw colour pickers | Hero presets are named options |
| No per-segment styling | Itinerary colours derive from type + theme |
| No free icon picker | Content tile icons are fixed enum |
| No manual reordering | Itinerary segments ordered by time |
| No CMS-style versioning | Live edits, snapshot exports |
| Notepad never leaks to client | Admin-only scoping |
| No attendees on segments | People tagging lives only in Notepad |
| Stays belong to one section | No cross-section stays |
| Empty days render placeholder | Never blank |
| Flights = Travel segments | No separate hierarchy |
| No merged data sources | Unified via `portal_items` |
| No PDF pipeline | Print stylesheet only |

